    // (⛔ #a-handed-on-merge-gives-its-dockyards-once — a state's copy, `buildings` and `navalDated`, with naval levels `levels` (stateNavalLevels' shape) taken back out
    // of it, every moment of them, asked before its undated levels change, as reconcileNavalCarry puts back a mirror the Save did not carry)
