  // A 1px river path from (x0,y0) to (x1,y1) that is ORTHOGONALLY connected — HOI4 requires rivers to be exactly
  // one pixel thick AND to never connect diagonally (pixels touching only at a corner don't count as joined and
  // render as artifacts). When a Bresenham step would move on both axes at once, we insert the corner bridge
